SYNTHETIC – a trace log of 3 lines whose last line has no line terminator (as when a log is
downloaded while it is being written); the first two lines end with LF.
Expected from LogExcerpt.build: 3 lines, numbers 1–3, the last one ending in "node1 step 2
running", complete and not cut.
Used by LogExcerptTest (tasks.md T015, research D-9).
